 "title": "Handling Early Nuclear Weapons",
 "cat": "history",
 "emoji": "☢️",
 "sentences": [
  "Early nuclear weapons couldn't be stored fully assembled.",
  "The Armed Forces Special Weapons Project managed these complex devices after the Manhattan Project ended.",
  "This joint military organization included the Army, Navy, and Air Force.",
  "Major General Leslie R. Groves served as its first chief.",
  "Short-lived batteries and heat from fissile cores forced these experts to keep components separate.",
  "Groves hand-picked officers to master the dangerous assembly process."
